000e1;ndez-&#x000c1;vila</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Los Retos del Convenio Marco para el Control del Tabaco en M&#x000e9;xico: Un Diagn&#x000f3;stico a Partir de la Encuesta sobre Tabaquismo en J&#x000f3;venes</article-title><source>Salud Publica Mex</source><year>2006</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>S5</fpage><lpage>S16</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17684690</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-ijerph-06-01254"><label>18.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vald&#x000e9;s-Salgado</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Reynales-Shiguematsu</surname><given-names>LM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lazcano-Ponce</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hernandez-Avila</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Before and After the Franework Convention on Tobacco Control in Mexico: A Comparison from the 2003 and 2006 Global Youth Tobacco Survey</article-title><source>Salud Publica Mex</source><year>2007</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>S155</fpage><lpage>S169</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17607478</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19-ijerph-06-01254"><label>19.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arillo-Santillan</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Thrasher</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodrigues-Bola&#x000f1;os</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Chavez-Ayala</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Ruiz-Velazco</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Lazcano-Ponce</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Susceptibility to Use Tobacco Among Non-smoking Students in 10 Mexican Cities</article-title><source>Salud Publica Mex</source><year>2007</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>S170</f